    "analysis": "The VBEP table stores schedule line data for sales orders in SAP. It is used to manage delivery schedules, track order quantities, and monitor delivery progress. VBEP is linked to other tables such as VBFA (sales order item data) and LIKP (delivery header data) through foreign key relationships. Common use cases include managing order scheduling, tracking inventory levels, and processing deliveries.",
